This skill is the deliberate exception to the "all new skills MUST be
symlinked to ~/.codex/skills/" rule. Its registry/*.yaml files contain
host-native command strings that must never be loaded into a foreign
host's skill corpus. See SKILL.md for the contamination rationale.

The bootstrap installer (installer/bootstrap-environment.py step 8) and
the publish pipeline (publish-to-github) MUST honour this sentinel and
skip symlinking this directory.
